; =============== Compilation Options for Xuan Tie =====================

m4k-opts
Target Var(riscv_4k_optimize) Init(0)
Optimize load instruction generation of loop.

mexpand-split-imm
Target Bool Var(riscv_expand_split_imm) Init(1) Undocumented
Enable split immediate operand in expand.

mccrt
Target Var(riscv_libcc_runtime)
Use code-size first compiler runtime instead of libgcc, it's only supported in rv32.

munaligned-libcall
Target Var(riscv_unaligned_libcall) Init(0)
Enable libcall for unaligned access.

mxor-combine
Target Var(riscv_combine_xor) Init(1) Undocumented
Optimize xor combine operation with constant.

mdelete-sext
Target Var(riscv_insn_dsext1) Init(1) Undocumented
Optimize code by deleting redundancy sext, insert before ree pass.

mdelete-sext2
Target Var(riscv_insn_dsext2) Init(1) Undocumented
Optimize code by deleting redundancy sext, insert after ree pass.

mload-merging
Target Var(riscv_load_merging) Init(0) Undocumented
Enable adjacent loads, and then extract for each element.

mfclass
Target Var(riscv_insn_fclass) Init(1) Undocumented
Enable fclass instruction.

mlcm-mcfg
Target Var(riscv_lcm_mcfg) Init(1) Undocumented
Redundancy elimination optimization for mcfg instructions using the LCM algorithm.

mextend_rtl_ifcvt_cost
Target Var(riscv_extend_rtl_ifcvt_cost) Init(1) Undocumented
Consider the set insn cost in test_bb.

mrvv-auto-vectorize
Target Var(riscv_rvv_auto_vectorize) Init(0) Undocumented
Support for automatic vectorization for rvv.

maggressive-schedule
Target Bool Var(riscv_aggressive_schedule) Init(0) Undocumented
Enable schedule an instruction to predecessor block even if it has more than one successor.

mfwprop2-address-opts
Target Var(riscv_fwprop2_address_optimize) Init(1) Undocumented
Optimize the gain of th_mem address for fwprop2.

mloop-dup-header-for-mod-pow2p-opts
Target Var(riscv_loop_dup_header_for_mod_pow2p_optimize) Init(1) Undocumented
Optimize loop dup header for mod pow2p.

msignedness-cmpiv
Target Bool Var(riscv_signedness_comparison_iv) Init(1) Undocumented
Enable signedness comparison when canonicalize induce varaible.

mthread-jumps1
Target Bool Var(riscv_thread_jumps1) Init(1)
Enable first pass of thread jumps optimization.

miv-adjust-addr-cost
Target Bool Var(riscv_iv_adjust_addr_cost) Init(1)
Enable address cost adjustment in pass loop-ivopts.

mrvv-v0p10-compatible
Target Bool Var(riscv_rvv_v0p10_compatible_p) Init(0)
Enable compatible support for rvv 0.10 version intrinsics.

mexpand-addsi-extend
Target Bool Var(riscv_expand_addsi_extend) Init(1)
Enable addsi extend operand in expand.

mvector-fast-mem
Target Bool Var(xt_vector_fast_memory_p) Init(1) Undocumented
Enable fast memory schedule for vector load/store on xt cpus.

mscalar-fast-mem
Target Bool Var(xt_scalar_fast_memory_p) Init(0) Undocumented
Enable fast memory schedule for scalar load/store on xt cpus.

pthread
Driver

mcall-arg-no-preload-large-imm
Target Var(riscv_call_arg_no_preload_large_imm) Init(0) Undocumented
Avoid preloading large immediate call arguments.

